<title>FRANCE: French staff invade CNP insurer board meeting.</title>
<headline>French staff invade CNP insurer board meeting.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Around 100 employees, inspired by a staff sit-in at Credit Foncier, invaded a supervisory board meeting at French state insurer CNP on Monday to protest against privatisation, unions at Caisse Nationale de Prevoyance said.</p>
<p>&quot;The CNP will not be tomorrow's Credit Foncier,&quot; the trade unions said in a statement.</p>
</text>
